 "notes": "PRIMARY SOURCE: official Motiva web catalogue (motiva.health Product Catalogue / Implant Matrix app), captured 2026-07. All values published in CM (no mm conversion needed). Catalogue rows also carry arc-length column(s) which were omitted here per requested schema (volume/diameter/projection only); Anatomical rows additionally include height_cm. ERGONOMIX vs ERGONOMIX2: same profile projections per base width, but Ergonomix2 (ProgressiveGel PLUS, catalog E2Sx) packs MORE VOLUME per base width than Ergonomix (ProgressiveGel Ultima, ERSx) - e.g. base 11.5 cm Demi: Ergonomix 300 cc vs Ergonomix2 325 cc; Ergonomix2 also extends one base width lower (8.00 cm). Ergonomix2 volume ladder differs (95-965 cc vs 105-925 cc in current catalogue). ROUND (SmoothSilk/SilkSurface PLUS, ProgressiveGel PLUS, catalog RSx): diameter/projection/volume ladder IDENTICAL to Ergonomix per official app (only arc length differs). GAP/CONFLICT 1: Ergonomix Corse 1050 cc (base 15.0, proj 7.8 cm) appears in the 2020 manufacturer catalogue and clinic tables, but the current official app shows '-' at base 15.00 - max Ergonomix Corse is now 925 cc. GAP/CONFLICT 2: Ergonomix2 Corse 1060 cc (base 15.0, proj 7.8 cm) appears in distributor charts and is implied by Establishment Labs 10-K ('up to 1060cc'), but the current app shows '-' at 15.00 - max listed is 965 cc. TRUFIXATION STATUS: Motiva Anatomical TrueFixation is STILL LISTED in the current official motiva.health catalogue (3 heights x 2 projections, Full and Corse projections only, 250-600 cc). Not FDA-approved in the US (US PMA P230005 covers Round and Ergonomix round only, Mini/Demi/Full, no Corse, no anatomical). US FDA: P230005 SSED ranges are consistent subsets of the international matrix (identical dims per size). Detailed FDA DFU table P230005D could not be machine-parsed cleanly (server blocked direct download), but extracted cells matched the international matrix. Flagship cross-checks: Ergonomix Demi 300 cc = 11.50 cm base / 3.9 cm proj (app = 2020 catalogue = 236z.com); Ergonomix Full 400 cc = 12.00 cm / 4.9 cm (app = 2020 catalogue = 236z.com); Ergonomix2 Demi 325 cc = 11.50 / 3.9 (app = distributor chart = ANMAT codes). All match. Not extracted: Ergonomix Oval (oval-horizontal) and GlutealArmonic tables (out of scope); older VelvetSurface families share the same dimension matrix."
